diff --git a/docs/api/sections/cards.md b/docs/api/sections/cards.md
index 800ed82..ea3e954 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/cards.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/cards.md
@@ -26,6 +26,8 @@ __Query Parameters:__
 
 Repeated `column_ids[]` values are ORed together. Other filters combine with AND.
 
+`indexed_by=stalled` lists open cards that are not postponed and have had no activity for two weeks after a burst of attention. An assignment, a reopening, or three comments by at least two people within a third of the board's auto-postpone period qualifies as a burst. New activity restarts the two-week clock.
+
